  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://lh3.google.com/u/0/d/1mJMKF859BvjTD0X8xh50RJAU10mYlxkL=w2520-h1330-iv1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1117\" height=\"240\"><br><img src=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aw/settings/Apocalypse w\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">開發者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fromano_catello%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brskatm123</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>新礦物</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong><br><img src=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/my-drive\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://lh3.google.com/u/0/d/1L86b-H5_nHpBjWyQXvJIsJ-QpUDQT7n2=w2520-h1368-iv1\" alt=\"\" width=\"385\" height=\"97\"></strong></em></span></p><h6><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080;text-decoration:underline\">暗黑精華礦生成於基岩附近</span></strong></span>（鑽石層下方）</span></h6><h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60;text-decoration:underline\">火焰精華礦生成於地獄</span></strong></span></h6><h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf;text-decoration:underline\">水流精華礦生成於海洋生態域</span></strong></span></h6><h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fc0;text-decoration:underline\">光明精華礦生成於沙漠生態域</span></strong></span></h6><h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#008000;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>大地精華礦生成於森林生態域</strong></span></span></h6><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h6><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px\"><strong>新植物</strong></span></h6><h6><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://lh3.google.com/u/0/d/1bAVDhFGfFU8g41dWyYsBjv5K2nlfyFvV=w1864-h991-iv2\" alt=\"\" width=\"383\" height=\"79\"></strong></span></h6><h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#800080;font-size:14px\"><strong>暗黑植物生成於山地生態域</strong></span></h6><h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f60;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>火焰植物生成於地獄的靈魂砂上</strong></span></span></h6><h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#0cf;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>水流植物生成於海灘生態域附近</strong></span></span></h6><h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#fc0;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>光明植物生成於沙漠生態域</strong></span></span></h6><h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#008000;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>大地植物生成於森林生態域</strong></span></span></h6><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>新特殊武器</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://lh3.google.com/u/0/d/1iMZ_4TwTLPLFtezI4Mp9eahUYQtF24Fd=w2520-h1330-iv5\" alt=\"\" width=\"367\" height=\"83\"></span></p><h6><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong>死亡之鎚消耗1個暗黑粉塵</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><strong>煉獄之斧消耗1個火焰粉塵</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;color:#0cf\"><strong>海嘯之劍消耗1個水流粉塵</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;color:#fc0\"><strong>雷霆之矛消耗1個光明粉塵</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#008000;font-size:14px\"><strong>地震鐮刀消耗1個大地粉塵</strong></span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#f00\"><strong>對方塊或空中右鍵施展能力（僅在1.12/1.14/1.15版本中消耗粉塵）</strong></span></h6><p>&nbsp;</p><h6><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>合成配方：</strong></span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>盔甲、方塊、工具（劍、鎬、鏟、斧和鋤）及木棒的合成方式與Minecraft原版相同。</strong></span></h6><p>&nbsp;</p><h6><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>最新更新功能：</strong></span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-size:xx-small\"><strong>1.2.9</strong></span></h6><p><span style=\"font-size:xx-small\"><strong>新增材質、調整特殊武器超能力、修復大量錯誤、新增動態方塊與植物，現在特殊武器不再消耗粉塵但冷卻時間增加，移除彩虹錠及其相關製作內容。修正工具傷害值並為基礎劍類武器新增效果。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h6><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:12px\"><strong>強烈建議搭配安裝Just Enough Items或Not Enough Items模組以查看詳細合成表</strong></span></h6><h6><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></h6><h6>&nbsp;</h6>",
